{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"何西阿书","commonName":"何西阿书","title":"何西阿书","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"0fd01139d1173aab3c4eae9aadc1f8604860ccbde5e4b3d2c68eec56323410c3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华指责以色列人拜偶像"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"“吹响号角警告众人吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敌人要如鹰扑向耶和华的家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为百姓背弃我的约，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"违背我的律法。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要向我呼求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘我们的上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们以色列人认识你。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列已经弃绝良善，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以敌人要追赶他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们拥立君王，未经我的同意；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"选立首领，没有让我知道。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们用金银为自己制造偶像，自取灭亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我鄙弃撒玛利亚人所拜的牛犊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要向他们发怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们到什么时候才能洁身自守呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这牛犊是以色列的工匠造的，并不是上帝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撒玛利亚的牛犊必被砸得粉碎。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们种的是风，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"收的是暴风。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的庄稼长不出穗子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"产不出面粉。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是有收成，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也要被外族人吃掉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列被吞灭了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他在列国之中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像无用的器皿。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们投奔亚述，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像孤独漂泊的野驴。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲收买情人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尽管他们在各国贿买盟友，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今我要把他们聚集起来审判。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必因君王和首领的欺压而日渐衰微。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"“以法莲增建许多除罪的祭坛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这些祭坛却成为他的犯罪之处。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我为他写下千万条的律法，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他却视若无睹。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们献给我祭牲，并吃祭肉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但不蒙耶和华的悦纳。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必记住他们的罪恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"追讨他们的罪债，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们回到埃及。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列忘记了他的创造主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"建造许多宫殿；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹大兴建许多坚城。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我要降火烧毁他们的城邑和堡垒。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}